{"title":"A big week for 15-year-old memes","link":"https://www.garbageday.email/p/a-big-week-for-15-year-old-memes","date":1740766750000,"content":"<div><div><p><i>Welcome to Garbage Weekend. It’s the internet garbage you know and love, but in a format that’s easier to read while you remember how short February is.</i></p><div><img src=\"https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/uploads/asset/file/e0cf4051-885b-4ef6-8203-36d56c721f8a/GettyImages-2201636087.jpg?t=1740759565\" /><div><span><p>(Photo by Alon Skuy/Getty Images)</p></span></div></div><p>This week, the Trump administration’s latest recruits include <a href=\"https://www.mediamatters.org/donald-trump/trump-meme-team-leader-brenden-dilley-theres-going-be-nobody-left-doing-podcasts-soon?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=a-big-week-for-15-year-old-memes\" target=\"_blank\">America’s strongest podcasters</a>. It’s too early to tell whether that includes alleged sex trafficker and center of the manosphere Andrew Tate, who’s <a href=\"https://www.cnn.com/2025/02/27/europe/andrew-tate-profile-intl/index.html?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=a-big-week-for-15-year-old-memes\" target=\"_blank\">staying in the country</a>. Maybe he’s here to <a href=\"https://abcnews.go.com/US/fbi-director-kash-patel-bring-ufc-fbi-sources/story?id=119255318&amp;utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=a-big-week-for-15-year-old-memes\" target=\"_blank\">train FBI agents</a> in self-defense! Podcasts could be an undervalued avenue for bipartisan consensus, though — just ask California Governor Gavin Newsom, who’s <a href=\"https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/business/digital/gavin-newsom-podcast-iheartmedia-interview-show-1236148135/?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=a-big-week-for-15-year-old-memes\" target=\"_blank\">starting his own</a>. At least they’re a better way to spread information than X, the everything app, where an official GOP account <a href=\"https://newrepublic.com/post/192117/gop-rick-rolls-jeffrey-epstein-files?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=a-big-week-for-15-year-old-memes\" target=\"_blank\">rickrolled people looking for the Epstein files</a>. And if you enjoy 15-year-old memes, get excited for <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KbiwL74KyJQ&amp;utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=a-big-week-for-15-year-old-memes\" target=\"_blank\"><i>Shrek 5</i></a><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KbiwL74KyJQ&amp;utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=a-big-week-for-15-year-old-memes\" target=\"_blank\"> with Zendaya</a>!</p><p>Oh well, here’s some fun stuff…</p><ul><li><p><a href=\"https://www.tumblr.com/prguitarman/775750194807635968?source=share&amp;utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=a-big-week-for-15-year-old-memes\" target=\"_blank\">A sword and its wielder</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://www.tumblr.com/fukazawashimpei/776332005982011392/five-cats?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=a-big-week-for-15-year-old-memes\" target=\"_blank\">Five cats</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/reel/DGDtoRAI_qU/?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=a-big-week-for-15-year-old-memes\" target=\"_blank\">An amazing craft project</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://x.com/NoahGarfinkel/status/1895337202265268654?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=a-big-week-for-15-year-old-memes\" target=\"_blank\">Good post</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://x.com/theballisorange/status/1894583615268225310?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=a-big-week-for-15-year-old-memes\" target=\"_blank\">Extremely cursed Cybertruck photo</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UyqbPF5IN54&amp;utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=a-big-week-for-15-year-old-memes\" target=\"_blank\">Stop motion chair car</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://www.tumblr.com/rslashrats/775024946695012352?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=a-big-week-for-15-year-old-memes\" target=\"_blank\">A handsome and alluring egg</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://www.reddit.com/r/doordash/comments/1iudzu2/the_dasher_took_a_photo_right_as_i_opened_the_door/?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=a-big-week-for-15-year-old-memes\" target=\"_blank\">Good DoorDash photo</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://defector.com/primanti-bros-the-defector-review?commentID=f19995be-b3c2-4209-a520-43ebfaa388f6&amp;utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=a-big-week-for-15-year-old-memes\" target=\"_blank\">Intensely emotional sandwich story</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://x.com/verysmallriver/status/1895237322087768073?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=a-big-week-for-15-year-old-memes\" target=\"_blank\">Slonch</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://www.tumblr.com/uglywhitefatherfigure/776283561090236416?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=a-big-week-for-15-year-old-memes\" target=\"_blank\">A thoughtful exchange on X, the everything app</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://www.tiktok.com/@jacob_acrobat/video/7459220946747002118?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=a-big-week-for-15-year-old-memes\" target=\"_blank\">Really sick TikTok</a></p></li></ul><div><hr /><div><h2> Subscribe to Premium to read the rest. </h2><p> Become a paying subscriber of Premium to get access to this post and other sub